Iran’s Navy deploys new units near Hormuz, warns ships against unauthorized transit 

The Iranian Army’s Navy says it has deployed operational units in a new formation east of the Strait of Hormuz and across the Sea of Oman and the Arabian Sea, after identifying a tanker that sustained damage and caught fire.

